.env
.env.local

## Credentials for the private NuGet feed. The Dockerfiles mount these as build
## secrets (docker build --secret id=nuget_token,env=NUGET_TOKEN), so they are
## read from the environment and never baked into an image layer. A file that
## held them would be committed by accident and would defeat the whole point.
nuget.token
nuget.username
